{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265WfL54KwN71794823363.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產屯門NOVO WALK 分行資深分區營業經理陳智生表示，上車客積極入市，二手交投平穩。分行新近促成屯門豫豐花園2座中層C室買賣成交，實用面積450平方呎，兩房間隔，景觀開揚，單位去年7月開始放盤，最初叫價438萬元，放盤逾一年，減價18萬元，新近以420萬元沽出，實用呎價9333元。<br/>陳智生表示，買家為上車客，心儀豫豐花園環境清幽，間隔實用，價錢相宜，見上址業主肯提供議價空間，遂入市上址自用。原業主於2010年以168.6萬元買入單位，持貨約16年，賬面賺251.4萬元，物業升值1.5倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.063430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:44.274445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:33.895485+00:00","content_hash":"f6e1bf129c6b1bb5edbc74bcdacd50c630dbdd7dc6c802d8513202864680987f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.063430+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}